    /// `<checksum>,<layout>` where checksum is a 4-digit hex CRC16 and layout
    /// encodes pane dimensions as `WxH,X,Y[,ID]` with `{...}` for horizontal
    /// splits and `[...]` for vertical splits.
    window_layout,
